[ti:“Roach Sirens”]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Hip-Hop & Rap]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]Kisi ki nafrat, kisi ka gussa
[00:12.15]Kisi ki maut, kisi ka kissa
[00:16.29]Har shakhs tha khada pal do pal yahan
[00:20.44]Thama sa ruka sa.. ab so gaya kyun?
[00:24.58]Pent khulwaye, khatna dhekhe
[00:28.73]Fir bhage ye jaan ko leke
[00:32.87]Inki lelo ek pal main jaan
[00:37.02]Fafed do is tarah ki tauba kare subah shaam
[00:41.16]They ran like roaches when the sirens came
[00:45.31]But they left behind blood and a mother's name
[00:49.45]You want heaven? I'll show you hell's gate
[00:53.60]One call — I'll make your whole crew late
[00:57.74]Tarbiyat? Taaleem? Nah that's a lie
[01:01.89]Kaun tha inka chhupa aaleem? Tell me why
[01:06.03]You teach a kid to kill before he learns to read?
[01:10.18]That's not a religion — that's a devil's seed
[01:14.32]Who raised you? Who trained you?
[01:18.47]Who's the hidden master behind the pain?
[01:22.61]You take a life — you take the chain
[01:26.76]Now every shadow whispers your name..
[01:30.90]22 April.. Pahalgam.. we remember
[01:35.05]This is not a drill — this is not a test
[01:39.19]You took their breath — now we take the rest
[01:43.34]I don't need a fatwa — I don't need a crown
[01:47.48]One step wrong — I'll tear your whole doctrine down
[01:51.63]Jalwa dikhaun, aag barsaun
[01:55.77]Har ek bhaage, raah na paaye
[01:59.92]Tauba karega har subah shaam
[02:04.06]Jab tera apna khoon chillayega — "Ya Allah, kyun?
[02:08.21]You asked for tarbiyat? You asked for taaleem?
[02:12.35]Here's your lesson — no mercy, no esteem
[02:16.50]The world watched Pahalgam bleed on a screen
[02:20.64]Now the world watches you.. deleted.. unseen
[02:24.79]Thama sa ruka sa.. ab jaag kyun gaya
[02:28.93]Har aansu, har laash, ek sawaal hai
[02:33.08]CHUPA AALIM — COME OUT AND FACE ME
[02:37.22]YOUR NAME ON THE WALL — YOUR THRONE — ERASE IT
[02:41.37]EVERY TOWN, EVERY TEMPLE, EVERY STREET, EVERY MOSQUE
[02:45.51]WE DON'T FORGET — WE DON'T STOP — WE DON'T DROP THIS
[02:49.66]Main darta hoon.. par main bhagogi nahi..
